    "header_color": "magenta",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "The body, and the world outside it.",
          "Every card here is a French name laid",
          "over an English one that never left.",
          "",
          "  stomach     beside belly",
          "  ocean       beside sea",
          "  tempest     beside storm",
          "  corpse      beside body",
          "",
          "Belly and sea are not lesser words.",
          "They are the ones you use when nobody",
          "is taking notes.",
          "",
          "THE NEXT 23 CARDS: flesh, weather and",
          "ground under French names."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Lesson 30"
      }
